---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroBg from '../assets/images/hero1.jpg';
---
<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-black">
    <Image 
      src={heroBg} 
      alt="Real Space Hub Background" 
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-bottom opacity-50"
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-end text-left">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium mb-8 fade-in backdrop-blur-sm shadow-2xl">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white"></span>
      Real Space Hub
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 fade-in delay-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight text-shadow-2xl text-end">
      Transforma tu inventario en una <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-white to-gray-300">máquina de ventas digital</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-gray-200 max-w-2xl mb-10 fade-in delay-200 text-shadow-2xl text-end">
      La plataforma todo-en-uno para desarrolladores inmobiliarios. Centraliza disponibilidad, cotizaciones y material comercial en una sola herramienta interactiva.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-start items-start w-full sm:w-auto fade-in delay-300">
      <a href="/demo" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-black font-bold rounded-lg transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)] transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center">
        Agendar presentación
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-black/40 hover:bg-black/60 border border-white/20 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-all backdrop-blur-sm shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] text-center">
        Ver demo online
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
